  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">為遊戲添加了可馴服的紅熊貓，並配備多種動畫，讓牠們和你的世界更加生動活潑。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">當你馴服牠們後，牠們的生命值會從8點提升到25點。你可以用非竹子的任何物品右鍵點擊牠們來切換行為模式。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">行為模式依序為：隨意走動、坐下、跟隨。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">當你設定為跟隨模式時，牠們會發出輕微的叫聲，讓你知道牠們準備好跟隨你了。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">預設情況下，牠們會生成在叢林、稀疏叢林和竹林叢林中。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">（在Forge中，您可以透過編輯data → biome tags和biome modifier資料夾中的json檔案，或透過資源包來更改此設定及其他生成設定；而在Fabric中則有對應的設定檔。）</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">遊戲中有2種變種。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">預設紅熊貓和喜馬拉雅紅熊貓，後者體型稍小，毛色略有變化。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">幼年紅熊貓則呈現較灰的顏色。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">你可以使用竹子來馴服、繁殖或治療牠們。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">閒置音效來自《Minecraft Dungeons》。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1453/799/638943377236658167.gif\" alt=\"bg\" width=\"551\" height=\"551\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">目前模組支援</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Forge&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1 | 1.20.1</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Fabric&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.5 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Neoforge 26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#f60;font-size:14px\"><strong>如果你需要在 CurseForge 上取得其他版本的模組，請私訊我</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f60;font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:14px\"><strong>在 X（Twitter）上追蹤我</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://x.com/Aquarius_playz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://x.com/Aquarius_playz</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1577/494/639022024300181764.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><a style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>此模組需要安裝 AquariusLibs</strong></a></span></p>",
